# Keep secrets and local state out of the image. Deliberately NOT excluding
# seed_staging.py or check_fk_orphans.py — STAGING_SETUP.md documents running
# the seeder inside the container, and the FK pre-flight is an operational tool.
# A few KB is not worth breaking a runbook.
.git
.venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
instance/
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
.env
.DS_Store
Baseline Files/
